  "slug": "compare-tally-ledger-opening-closing-balance",
  "title": "Comparing Opening and Closing Balances in a Tally Ledger",
  "description": "Trace a balance difference using the same period, counterpart ledger and debit or credit signs.",
  "category": "Ledgers and PDFs",
  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "Compare the same dates and ledger",
      "body": "Start by matching the exact company, party and date range in TallyPrime and Syncora. Record how each report labels its opening and closing balances. A displayed debit or credit sign matters when you compare amounts."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Separate starting balance from period movements",
      "body": "If the two opening balances differ, investigate the start date or earlier entries before inspecting the current period. If opening matches and closing differs, compare movements within the period. Look for a missing voucher or amount difference by type and number."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Leave a comparison note",
      "body": "Record both displayed balances and the last successful sync time. If you cannot confirm a reliable balance in Syncora, use the corresponding original TallyPrime ledger for the comparison and keep the discrepancy available for review."
    }
  ],
